<div class="wrap"><div class="note">Provider accepted means the mail service accepted the message. Inbox receipt is not confirmed. Showing the latest 100 job alert records; verification and test emails are not job alerts.</div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-h"><h3>Your alert history</h3></div><% if(!rows.length){ %><div class="empty"><b>No job alert records yet</b><span>Check your interests and watch status. A job in the Wire does not necessarily match your email selection.</span></div><% } %><% rows.forEach(row=>{const labels={sent:'Provider accepted',pending:'Queued / retry scheduled',sending:'Submitting',blocked:'Provider blocked',dead:'Delivery stopped',cancelled:'Cancelled'}; %><article class="job-card-row"><div class="job-body"><a class="job-title" href="/job/<%= row._id %>"><%= row.job?.title || 'Job details' %></a><p><%= row.job?.company || '' %></p><small>Created <%= new Date(row.createdAt).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'Asia/Colombo'}) %> · Sri Lanka time</small><% if(row.status==='pending'&&row.nextAttemptAt){ %><p>Next eligible attempt: <%= new Date(row.nextAttemptAt).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'Asia/Colombo'}) %></p><% } %></div><span class="pill"><%= labels[row.status] || 'Unknown state' %></span></article><% }) %></section></div>